5: // cron (and the sync_jev_dataset tool) flushes pending rows into the HuggingFace
6: // dataset ctaxnagomi/DGUI_HYPERMEM-JEV via the documented upload API:
7: //   read current train.jsonl -> append new rows -> re-upload (+ metadata.json).
8: // Over time the dataset grows into a fine-tuning/few-shot corpus for the JEV layer.
